test/fixtures/Makefile.docs-precedence
#: stdout
== test/fixtures/Makefile.docs-precedence
   1 . -   1  0 | ## Top doc (takes precedence over inline docs)
   2 . R   0  0 | t1: ## Inline doc (not displayed)
   2 ========== => target:t1
   3 . R   0  0 |
   4 . R   0  0 | t2: ## Inline doc without top docs
