   5 . R   0  0 |
   6 . R   1  0 | ## Not displayed because t3 is redefined below
   7 . R   0  0 | t3:
   7 ========== => target:t3
   8 . R   0  0 | t3: ## A new rule with a doc replaces the docs of t3
   8 ========== => target:t3
   9 . R   0  0 |
  10 . R   1  0 | ##
  11 . R   0  0 | t4: ## An empty top doc shadows this inline doc
  11 ========== => target:t4
  12 . R   0  0 |
